---
import PillarLayout from '../../layouts/PillarLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<PillarLayout slug="fireplaces-gas">

  <section class="section bg-sand-2" style="padding:clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0">
    <div class="container pillar-detail__wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow"><Icon name="flame" size={15} /> Gas-certified, NG and LP</span>
      <h2>The warmth of a fire, without the wood</h2>
      <div class="pillar-detail__body">
        <p>A gas fireplace adds real warmth and comfort to a room, and we carry and install units from Continental, Kingsman, and Empire Comfort Systems. We also service existing fireplaces, whether the pilot will not stay lit, the flame pattern is off, or it is due for a clean and inspection.</p>
        <p>Because we are gas-certified for both natural gas and propane, we also run new gas lines, repair and replace old ones, and connect BBQs, cooktops, dryers, and gas fire pits. The fuel side of the work is handled by the same licensed crew as the rest.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="pillar-detail__bullets" style="background:var(--sand)">
        <li><Icon name="check" size={16} /> Gas fireplace supply, install, and service</li>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={16} /> NG and LP gas line install and repair</li>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={16} /> BBQ hookups and appliance connections</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

</PillarLayout>
